    "title": "Goodyear 400 Results: NASCAR Stage Results Today, Race Winner, Points Totals from Darlington",
    "text": "Who won the NASCAR race today? In the days leading up to the Goodyear 400 at Darlington Raceway, many drivers expected there to be chaos with a lot of tire ware thanks to the increase in horsepower and changes to the car. We certainly got an entertaining race on Sunday afternoon, with the Goodyear 400 results delivering some big surprises inside the top 10 and another Tyler Reddick win.Let’s dive into the NASCAR results today from Darlington for the Cup Series race. We’ll start with the full results for the Goodyear 400, including points totals, followed by the NASCAR stage results today at Darlington.AdvertisementRelated: Winners, Losers from the NASCAR Race Today at DarlingtonHere are the Goodyear 400 results today.PositionDriverPoints1Tyler Reddick60 (15 stage points)2Brad Keselowski55 (20 stage points)3Ryan Blaney42 (8 stage points)4Carson Hocevar335Austin Cindric38 (6 stage points)6Ty Gibbs33 (2 stage points)7Daniel Suarez33 (3 stage points)8William Byron34 (5 stage points)9Chris Buescher42 (14 stage points)10Erik Jones2711Denny Hamlin2612Chase Briscoe33 (7 stage points)13Ryan Preece29 (5 stage points)14Shane van Gisbergen2315Chase Elliott26 (4 stage points)16Ross Chastain2117Josh Berry2018Connor Zilisch1919Christopher Bell1820Michael McDowell1721Kyle Busch1622Zane Smith1523Todd Gilliland1424Justin Allgaier1325Austin Dillon1226Noah Gragson1127John H. Nemechek1028Cole Custer929Ricky Stenhouse Jr830AJ Allmendinger731Ty Dillon632Kyle Larson19 (14 stage points)33Joey Logano434Bubba Wallace11 (7 stage points + 1 fastest lap)35Riley Herbst236Cody Ware137Timmy Hill—Related: NASCAR Standings After Darlington, Cup Series Points Leaders Right NowNASCAR Cup Series Stage Results at DarlingtonHere are the NASCAR Stage Results today for the Cup Series race, the Goodyear 400, at Darlington.Goodyear 400 Stage 1 ResultsGoodyear 400 Stage 2 ResultsPositionDriverStage Points1Brad Keselowski102Ryan Blaney93Tyler Reddick84Bubba Wallace75Kyle Larson66Chris Buescher57Cha